					"nextDialogs": [
						722320304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "工整的字条"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320304,
					"content": "（最后部分记录了「特殊作战」的完成情况，以及落款：由一位化名为「内森」的愚人众成员所留。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "工整的字条"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320305,
					"content": "（在纸条的一侧还有一些细小文字：）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "工整的字条"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320306,
					"content": "「…前来寻回此报告的愚人众新募人员，须尽快前往岛屿西侧港口，与接洽情报官会合。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "工整的字条"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320307,
					"content": "「口令为：『笑死我了』。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "工整的字条"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7223204,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7223205
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7223205",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7223205,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"？？？",
					"思鹤"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 722320401,
					"content": "止步！平民，为了你自己的安全，请离开这里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320402,
					"content": "不好意思，我们不是平民。而且我们来这里是有原因的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320403,
					"content": "我们是来接洽愚人众情报官的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722320404,
					"content": "我不知道你们在说什么…这里是私人领地，请不要和我们搭话了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320405,
					"content": "穿着这样过分浮夸的衣服，手里拿的武器既不像幕府军的装备、也不像珊瑚宫军的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320406,
					"content": "看起来随时要跑路，一副不怀好意的样子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320407,
					"content": "你们还是多在意一下伪装比较好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320408,
					"content": "我看起来像是会开玩笑的人吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320409,
					"content": "#好了，不说笑了。我们是从蛇骨矿洞那边来的。{NICKNAME}，请证明给他看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320410,
					"content": "笑死我了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320411
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722320411,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320412,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320413,
					"content": "欢迎加入愚人众，我是你们的接应人，海务准尉鲍连卡。今后你们要叫我「长官」，听懂了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320414,
					"content": "他们和我说，勘定奉行那些丢了官职、没了俸禄的前部属很快就会取到我们想要的东西…没想到只有你们两个。我还以为会有很多人呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320415,
					"content": "一个是说话很不客气的巫女，还有一个是…外国人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320416,
					"content": "你们都不是武士吗？哼，柊慎介那家伙的用人眼光还真是有意思。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320417,
						722320418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320417,
					"content": "确实如此。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320419
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722320419,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320420,
					"content": "…长官。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320421
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722320421,
					"content": "我们之前进行了一些…管理层变动。所以你也明白，从结果上讲，有的人可以赢得新工作，有的人就只能落进海里，什么也留不下咯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320422,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320423,
					"content": "…长官。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320424,
					"content": "嗯，你说得对。我不关心你们之前发生了什么，我想要的只有结果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320425,
					"content": "把「内森」留下的报告交给我，然后上船。这是一个简单的命令，希望你们能够好好执行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320426,
					"content": "就在这里了…长官。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320427
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722320427,
					"content": "很好。你们在这里的工作结束了，还有什么问题吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320428,
					"content": "我们之后还有什么任务吗，长官？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320429,
					"content": "与我何干？我只负责把你们运回至冬国，之后的行动就要听从上面的意思了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320430,
					"content": "上面没有透露任何消息吗，长官？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320431,
					"content": "与你何干？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320432
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320432,
					"content": "你说得对，长官。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320433,
						722320434
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320433,
					"content": "（可以动手了吗？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320435
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722320435,
					"content": "（请您再等一会儿，我想试试看套些情报。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320436
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320436,
					"content": "我还在这里呢，你们两个在鬼鬼祟祟说什么呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320437
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320437,
					"content": "抱歉，关于将来需要我们执行的任务，许多细节我们还不清楚，请问长官可不可以为我们讲解？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320438
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320438,
					"content": "我没有义务给你们讲解命令，留给你们的选择只有执行，或者被我教训一顿，然后执行！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320439
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320439,
					"content": "抱歉，或许你没有听明白。我的意思是…咳咳，请问你可不可以把你所知道的，全都毫无保留地告诉我们？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320440
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320440,
					"content": "你是不是忘了什么，新兵…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320441
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320441,
					"content": "我什么也没有忘记。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320442
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320442,
					"content": "相反，我什么都记得清清楚楚。我相信我身边的这位珊瑚宫将领也是如此。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320443
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320443,
					"content": "你…珊瑚宫？！我就知道…！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320444
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320444,
					"content": "是啊，你可真了不起…不过我已经听烦你的话了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320445
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320445,
					"content": "你们在八酝岛的秘密行动、你们煽动海祇岛激进派破坏镇物的罪证，你们勾结失主武士的证据…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320446
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320446,
					"content": "以及刚刚对一位珊瑚宫巫女的羞辱，我都记录在案。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320447
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320447,
					"content": "前面几个问题或许会作为外交事件进入珊瑚宫的备忘录。而最后的那个问题，我希望你能够亲自负责，「长官」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320448
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320448,
					"content": "顺便，我一开始就忠告过了，你们还是多在意一下伪装比较好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320449
					],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320449,
					"content": "#请您动手吧，{NICKNAME}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "思鹤"
				},
				{
					"id": 722320434,
					"content": "（我们还要继续和他过家家吗？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320435
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722320418,
					"content": "很难和你解释。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722320419
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7223205,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7223207
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7223207",
